  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental surveillance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Milj&#xf6;&#xf6;vervakning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Belorussia will soon have operating NPP:s and co-operation on environmental surveillance is therefore vital to Sweden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Vitryssland bygger ny k&#xe4;rnkraft och milj&#xf6;&#xf6;vervakning &#xe4;r d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r av vikt f&#xf6;r Sverige</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Myndigheterna i Belarus, Sverige, Norge samt Finland samarbetar om att skapa en &#xf6;kad gemensam f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;else f&#xf6;r omgivningsfr&#xe5;gor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Belorussioan nuclear authority, as well as the Swedish, Finnish and Norwegian ones, have had conferences which aim at getting agreements on mutual understanding on environmental surveillance issues.</narrative>
  </description>
